; SET A v3: MAX PROFIT — ENGULF only + BE/Trail fix + relaxed entry filters
; Based on SetA_v2 backtest (g.xlsx): PF=1.71, R:R=3.43x, Edge=+10.7pp
; Problem: Only 18 trades in 6 months — too few for statistical significance
;
; v3 changes vs v2:
; 1. EngulfMinBodyRatio 2.0→1.5 (allow more valid engulfing setups)
; 2. MinBodyRangeRatio 0.4→0.3 (slightly more relaxed candle quality)
; 3. CooldownBars 5→3 (15min cooldown vs 25min)
; 4. MaxDailyLosses 3→4 (one more chance per day)
; 5. VolumeMultiplier 1.2→1.0 (require above-avg volume, less strict)
; 6. TPMultiplier 3.0→2.5 (easier to hit TP → more wins)
; 7. MinRRRatio 2.0→1.5 (allow entries that v2 rejected)
; 8. NEW: BETriggerRR=1.0 (lock breakeven at 1R — v4.5 feature)
; 9. TrailATRMult 1.0→1.5 (wider trail to avoid premature exit)
;
; Expected: ~2-3x more trades, slightly lower R:R but higher WR
; BE+Trail now active → converts some SL losses into BE/small wins
